OL,3,GNEWSAChoir for singers with
OL,4,Acommunication difficulties is 'one big
OL,5,Afamily'
OL,6,
OL,7,FEvery Thursday evening, a community
OL,8,Fhall in York is filled with the sounds
OL,9,Fof singing and the sights of sign
OL,10,Flanguage - as well as the warmth of a
OL,11,Fcommunity described as "one big
OL,12,Ffamily".
OL,14,FThe Hands and Voices Choir, run by
OL,15,Fcharity Accessible Arts and Media
OL,16,F(AAM), was set up in 1997 to help
OL,17,Fpeople with learning and communication
OL,18,Fdifficulties take part in music.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
