OL,3,GNEWSAChoir for singers with
OL,4,Acommunication difficulties is 'one big
OL,5,Afamily'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt has about 30 members, including
OL,8,FPatrick Corker, who has been in the
OL,9,F"very important" choir for "a long
OL,10,Ftime", he says.
OL,12,FSpeaking through an electronic
OL,13,Fcommunication device, he adds: "I enjoy
OL,14,Fsinging, signing and meeting friends."
